      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Elizabethton is the historic site of the first independent American government, the Watauga Association, formed in 1772.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabethton%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The annual Covered Bridge Days festival celebrates the town’s historic covered bridge park, a landmark of Appalachian architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
